title: DGA Domain Generation NXDOMAIN Burst
id: 87697aca-13b7-40c6-8bf3-776b7ad3346f
status: experimental
description: Detects DGA-related NXDOMAIN bursts.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1568/002/
logsource:
  category: dns
detection:
  selection:
    response_code: 'NXDOMAIN'
  timeframe: 5m
  condition: selection | count() by src_ip > 50
fields:
  - src_ip
  - query
falsepositives:
  - Misconfigured applications generating bad lookups
level: high
tags:
  - attack.command_and_control
  - attack.t1568.002
